## Testing

### Automated Test Suite
```bash
PYTHONPATH=. python3 -m unittest tests.test_redfish_server
```
Test classes: `RedfishServerPortTests`, `AuthManagerTests`, `SystemsPatchTests`, `SystemsHandlerPayloadTests`, `VirtualMediaHandlerTests`, `ManagersPostRoutingTests`, `SSLCertificateGenerationTests`

### Manual Smoke Test
```bash
curl -s http://localhost:8443/redfish/v1/ | python3 -m json.tool
curl -s -u admin:password http://localhost:8443/redfish/v1/Systems/vm-name | python3 -m json.tool
```

