## Metal3/OpenShift Integration

### Critical Endpoints
- `/redfish/v1/UpdateService` - FirmwareInventory, SoftwareInventory
- `/redfish/v1/TaskService/Tasks` - Task history (60+ tasks expected)
- `/redfish/v1/Systems/{id}/Storage` - RAID controller discovery
- `/redfish/v1/Managers/{id}/VirtualMedia` - ISO mounting for deployment

### BMH Address Format
- HTTP mode (`disable_ssl: true`): `http://host:8443/redfish/v1/Systems/vm-name`
- HTTPS mode: `redfish://host:8443/redfish/v1/Systems/vm-name`
- **Always use HTTP for Metal3** to avoid certificate issues

See `openshift/README.md` for complete BMH testing guide.

---

## Common Issues

| Problem | Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------|-----|
| `Address already in use` | Port conflict on `redfish_port` | `sudo ss -tlnp \| grep 8443` then kill process |
| `Failed to initialize VMware client` | vCenter unreachable | Check network, credentials, DNS |
| BMH stuck in `inspecting` | Missing endpoints | Check UpdateService, Storage, TaskService return 200 |
| SSL handshake errors | Certificate issues | Use `disable_ssl: true` in config |
| Service won't start | Bad config JSON | Validate JSON; ensure `vms` or `datacenter_folders` present |

